; Original Brickwright CP5-style binary workbench.
; A closed switch grounds its input (0); an open switch reads 1.
; Terminal 1 / P1.0 / P2.0 is the least significant bit.
SETTLE EQU 200
POLL EQU 100
ORG 0
start:  AKO 0
        P2A 0
        VZG SETTLE
sample: P1E 0
        ABS observed
        P2A 0
        ANZ
        VZG POLL
        SPU sample
ORG 32
observed: DATA 0
